They all have the similar root cause.

00:36:15.054 --> 00:36:18.574
And, you know, I hired this person when I didn't believe that they're the right person.

00:36:18.574 --> 00:36:21.853
We made this pricing change when I feel like, you know, saying like there's a bunch of these

00:36:21.853 --> 00:36:22.853
little things along the way.

00:36:22.853 --> 00:36:24.093
I'm like, why?

00:36:24.093 --> 00:36:25.093
Why did that happen?

00:36:25.934 --> 00:36:26.934
Why did I do it?

00:36:26.934 --> 00:36:27.934
You know, I'm free will.

00:36:27.934 --> 00:36:28.934
Right.

00:36:28.934 --> 00:36:29.934
Like, so what's going on?

00:36:29.934 --> 00:36:36.333
So it's for me, that was the moment where I realized, oh, I am not trusting myself enough.

00:36:36.333 --> 00:36:41.054
And so now I'm like, I have started pushing myself to say, how deeply do I trust?

00:36:41.054 --> 00:36:43.653
Like, how do we how deeply do I believe this?

00:36:43.653 --> 00:36:49.694
And am I willing to stand up to everybody and say, no, we're doing this because I feel

00:36:49.694 --> 00:36:53.934
very strongly that this is right, you know, it's like this level of and then and so then

00:36:53.934 --> 00:36:58.653
the real danger for me, what I worry about a lot is like, how do you not become overly

00:36:58.653 --> 00:37:01.893
confident and you stop listening to advice?

00:37:01.893 --> 00:37:07.494
But but historically, I've not trusted like where I was before was actually more dangerous

00:37:07.494 --> 00:37:11.533
because I'm doing things that I'm not really sure are right.

00:37:11.533 --> 00:37:13.454
My gut's telling me to do something else.

00:37:13.454 --> 00:37:16.893
And I'm going along with what people have told me.

00:37:16.893 --> 00:37:23.374
But so now I'm in a world where if I feel strongly about something, I'm comfortable

00:37:23.814 --> 00:37:25.814
going up against pretty much everybody.

00:37:25.814 --> 00:37:26.814
Right.

00:37:26.814 --> 00:37:29.733
And Hadley's, I'd be unfortunate position of watching that.

00:37:29.733 --> 00:37:33.333
Like, I've gone up against the board in the last year and a half pretty strongly about

00:37:33.333 --> 00:37:34.694
a variety of things.

