I've gone up against Hadley and Joe in like the last three or four months where I'm like,

00:37:39.014 --> 00:37:42.174
listen, I feel very strongly this is where the world is going and I know that we don't

00:37:42.174 --> 00:37:43.174
love it.

00:37:43.174 --> 00:37:44.174
But like, here's what I think.

00:37:44.174 --> 00:37:45.174
Right.

00:37:45.174 --> 00:37:48.494
And I don't take that lightly because, you know, I have tremendous respect.

00:37:48.494 --> 00:37:53.413
The caliber of talent that we have in this company is, you know, is remarkable.

00:37:53.413 --> 00:37:58.574
And so it's a big thing to sort of stand up to tell people like, I think I'm I think we're

00:37:58.574 --> 00:37:59.574
going to go this way.

00:37:59.574 --> 00:38:00.574
Yeah.

00:38:00.574 --> 00:38:01.574
Yeah.

