And I feel like this is such an interesting variant of imposter syndrome that I'd never

00:38:21.973 --> 00:38:28.454
really thought about, like that kind of like, yeah, not not trusting yourself, right.

00:38:28.454 --> 00:38:35.254
Or your gut when maybe in the face of an expert, you feel like, oh, I feel like I maybe need

00:38:35.254 --> 00:38:41.174
to dig in more or kind of like trust my instinct.

