That's a lot of board meetings where I'm stuck with this thing that doesn't quite work.

00:40:14.494 --> 00:40:16.773
Right. I'm like, how do we solve this problem?

00:40:16.773 --> 00:40:19.934
And he's like, well, you know, if you could hire and could hire another engineer to work

00:40:19.934 --> 00:40:21.454
on it, that would work. All right.

