and, and college, do you feel like you were like, I'm a be a CEO, you know, or

00:51:31.734 --> 00:51:32.974
like what, what was going on?

00:51:32.974 --> 00:51:35.253
Like, what got you to where you are?

00:51:36.773 --> 00:51:38.214
Like, take us back.

00:51:38.773 --> 00:51:41.133
I started writing on LinkedIn starting in May, right?

00:51:41.133 --> 00:51:45.013
Like that was the, that was a two year ramp up to convince myself, like I should

00:51:45.013 --> 00:51:48.334
do it and I'm going to commit to it, to, to sort of writing twice a week, which

